@meeting sickExam2
// Head writer 4: being ill, Rina's exam, variant two.
title: The infirmary
from: Rina Deshi
gist: Rina in the infirmary: a bug going round Deck 4, some medicine, and the rest of the day off.
== lines
rina: Oh, look. Another one. You're the fourth from Deck 4 this week.   [sigh]
rina > you: Light in your eyes. Follow my finger. Good. Now the other way. Good.
rina: It's the bug going round. Someone sneezed in the lift and now here we are.
rina: Medicine. Here. It tastes like a boot. That's how you know it's working.
rina > you: Drink it. All of it. I'm watching.   [listen]
rina: Good. You're excused today. It doesn't touch your leave. It's not your fault you've got a body.
rina: Go and lie down. If I see you at the Tiles table tonight, I'm winning by default.
